#: admin/class-afpv-admin.php:295 admin/class-afpv-admin.php:599
msgid ""
"Add your YouTube video ID like (6lt2JfJdGSY). Do not put complete video URL "
"only enter video ID that come after this URL "
"(https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=)"
msgstr "Adja meg a YouTube-videó ID-ját, például (6lt2JfJdGSY). Ne a teljes videó-URL-t adja meg, hanem csak az URL után következő ID-t (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=)"

#: admin/class-afpv-admin.php:299 admin/class-afpv-admin.php:603
msgid "Facebook Video URL"
msgstr "facebook-videó-URL"

#: admin/class-afpv-admin.php:301 admin/class-afpv-admin.php:606
msgid ""
"Add facebook video link here, e.g "
"(https://www.facebook.com/facebook/videos/XXXXXXXXXXXXX)"
msgstr "Adja meg itt a facebook-videó linkjét, például (https://www.facebook.com/facebook/videos/XXXXXXXXXXXXX)"

#: admin/class-afpv-admin.php:306 admin/class-afpv-admin.php:610
msgid "instagram Video URL"
msgstr "Instagram-videó URL-je"

#: admin/class-afpv-admin.php:308 admin/class-afpv-admin.php:613
msgid ""
"Enter only the Instagram Reel ID (for example: DZP5xx1M3CX). Do not enter "
"the full URL. The ID is the part that comes after "
"https://www.instagram.com/reels/."
msgstr "Csak az Instagram Reel ID-ját adja meg (például: DZP5xx1M3CX). Ne adja meg a teljes URL-t. Az ID a https://www.instagram.com/reels/ utáni rész."

#: admin/class-afpv-admin.php:314 admin/class-afpv-admin.php:618
msgid "tiktok Video URL"
msgstr "TikTok-videó URL-je"

#: admin/class-afpv-admin.php:316 admin/class-afpv-admin.php:621
msgid ""
"Enter only the TikTok video ID (for example: 7647554785960671). Do not enter"
" the full URL. The video ID is the numeric part that comes after "
"https://www.tiktok.com/@username/video/."
msgstr "Csak a TikTok-videó ID-ját adja meg (például: 7647554785960671). Ne adja meg a teljes URL-t. A videó ID-ja a https://www.tiktok.com/@username/video/ utáni szám."

